        {
          "text": "Na hao watu walipomwona wakamhimidi mungu wao, maana walisema, Mungu wetu amemtia mikononi mwetu huyu adui wetu, aliyeiharibu nchi yetu na kuwaua watu wengi miongoni mwetu. ",
