        {
          "text": "Ikawa mioyo yao iliposhangilia, wakasema, Mwiteni Samsoni, ili atufanyie michezo. Basi wakamwita Samsoni atoke gerezani, akacheze mbele yao wakamweka katikati ya nguzo mbili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samsoni akamwambia yule kijana aliyemshika mkono, Niache nizipapase nguzo ambazo nyumba hii inazikalia, nipate kuzitegemea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
